  {
    "id": "2026-10-24-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-24T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "週末要出門，先把媽媽包倒出來數一數。\n手帕、尿布、濕紙巾、備用衣、奶嘴、玩具、半包餅乾、不明的塑膠袋。\n留言報數字：你家出門一趟，包包裡幾樣東西？\n小鷹報 23，其中 9 條是手帕（職業病）。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1024-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "a900b2322266d3b6492b3c51ab971150ec7c496c334d5c3eebce52afecd35400",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "schedule.json#2026-10-24",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "claude (CLAUDE_AUTHORIZATION §6)",
    "approved_at": "2026-10-24T17:47:16+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-10-25-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-25T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "第一胎：出門前推車擦三遍，奶嘴掉地上直接丟。\n第二胎：奶嘴吹一吹，推車在哪裡都不確定。\n第三胎的爸媽請先不要說話，我們承受不起。\n留言補你家的版本，我先：第一胎手帕繡名字，第二胎直接用姐姐的。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1025-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "22266c58e3bcbaf77965db063cfc250d16324eabd8e50fda6ad754c89f20137a",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
