  },
  {
    "id": "2026-10-26-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-26T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "上次路人 NPC 台詞排行榜大家補得太精彩，今天開第二季：阿公阿嬤版。\n第一名：穿這樣會不會冷？（長輩版威力加倍）\n第二名：給他吃一點點沒關係啦。\n第三名：我以前都是這樣帶的。\n後面交給你們，留言接龍，越真實越好。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1026-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "417f1bc922c6ca66cca8f1bf6f919309888280aac93b962b55d72fbb02f3443f",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "schedule.json#2026-10-26",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "claude (CLAUDE_AUTHORIZATION §6)",
    "approved_at": "2026-10-24T17:47:16+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-10-27-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-27T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "口水期的家長，請誠實回答。\n一天換幾條圍兜？留言報數字，最高的那位小鷹敬你一杯（水）。\n小鷹辦公室的紀錄是 7 條，還是同一個小孩。\n圍兜的款式怎麼挑，官網有整理：\nhttps://www.ihibou.com/articles/parenting-bib-guide",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1027-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "3d3665ecf2196da4da4f7de7ffc5f1698f26ee4b549fdeec1196cea94ef4ce31",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "schedule.json#2026-10-27",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "claude (CLAUDE_AUTHORIZATION §6)",
    "approved_at": "2026-10-24T17:47:16+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-10-28-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-28T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "萬聖節倒數三天，各位的小孩今年要扮什麼？\n留言報裝扮，小鷹用專業眼光評分（評分標準：好不好穿脫、會不會被路人多拍兩張）。\n小鷹今年的提案：扮成「剛睡醒」，零成本，神還原。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1028-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "d20c8d27f8ae79d3b24fcf24378c4a2710a206d90da24426c84953b34e06ebe4",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
    "source": "schedule.json#2026-10-28",
    "status": "approved",
    "approved_by": "claude (CLAUDE_AUTHORIZATION §6)",
    "approved_at": "2026-10-24T17:47:16+08:00"
  },
  {
    "id": "2026-10-29-bedtime",
    "slot": "bedtime",
    "publish_at": "2026-10-29T21:30:00+08:00",
    "media_type": "IMAGE",
    "text": "出門前三秒檢查清單：\n奶嘴在不在，手帕在不在，小孩在不在。\n第四項留言接龍，你家每次都忘的那一樣。\n小鷹的奶嘴都用夾子夾在衣服上，掉了也還在；夾子不繞脖子、不掛脖子上喔。",
    "image_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JuiHsuan-otto/hibou-social/main/social/images/2026/1029-bedtime.jpg",
    "image_sha256": "c95dc3ace037a6978a69331c0e182a5c8d7a4bd05e9d37495c8d0a757bbef200",
    "link": null,
    "topic_tag": "育兒日常",
    "self_reply": null,
    "pin_after_post": false,
